  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Alkanes are very less reactive, tertiary hydrogen can oxidise to alcohol with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>KMnO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math>.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/bf0124fc-48b7-4948-b5a8-1f4dc923845a-image.png\" style=\"width: 372px; height: 82px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>methylbutane</mi></math></p>",
